WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.230
GALARC KINGDOM, NOIX,
BELONGING TO DUKE CRETIA

00:07.900 --> 00:09.160
That thing...

00:09.490 --> 00:12.030
It sure looks like a dragon.

00:12.030 --> 00:15.050
Fortunately, it didn't seem to notice us,

00:15.050 --> 00:17.620
but I feared it might be dangerous
to fly to Amande,

00:17.620 --> 00:19.250
so I made the emergency landing.

00:19.670 --> 00:22.580
It was a quick and correct decision, Captain.

00:22.580 --> 00:24.390
I thank you for this.

00:25.520 --> 00:29.370
I accept your gratitude wholeheartedly.

00:29.370 --> 00:30.510
Lady Liselotte.

00:30.900 --> 00:33.850
That seems to be
Duke Huguenot's magic ship.

00:53.030 --> 00:55.580
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

01:55.870 --> 01:59.470
You three, disable the barrier,
and attack accordingly.

02:00.500 --> 02:01.740
Magic Cannon!

02:06.230 --> 02:09.420
THE BRAVE AND THE HERO

02:09.420 --> 02:10.870
Lady Liselotte.

02:11.650 --> 02:13.830
Welcome to our nation.

02:13.830 --> 02:15.620
It has been a while.

02:15.620 --> 02:18.790
It sure has, Baronet Bochsa.

02:18.790 --> 02:20.540
Hey there, Liselotte.

02:21.330 --> 02:23.870
Have you met with Beltrum's hero?

02:23.870 --> 02:25.500
Master Hiroaki.

02:25.500 --> 02:29.310
Yes, I have, thanks to you.

02:29.310 --> 02:31.680
I have delivered the invitation as well.

02:31.680 --> 02:34.130
But why are you all here?

02:34.850 --> 02:38.120
Huguenot seems to have business in Galarc.

02:38.550 --> 02:42.140
He also said he'd be visiting Amande as well,
so we decided to join in, but...

02:42.660 --> 02:45.740
You met with that in the sky, right?

02:45.740 --> 02:47.940
Well, that's the gist of it.

02:48.660 --> 02:51.560
Seems like we need to discuss

02:51.560 --> 02:54.610
how to process information
and to deal with it.

02:55.060 --> 02:59.100
Baronet Bochsa,
would you mind giving us a place.

02:59.100 --> 03:00.510
Of course.

03:00.510 --> 03:03.870
It may be cramped,
but feel free to visit my manor.

03:03.870 --> 03:08.050
BELTRUM KINGDOM, RODANIA TERRITORY,
BELONGING TO MARQUESS RODAN

03:08.050 --> 03:09.750
That's the Rodan territory for you.

03:10.550 --> 03:14.870
Even when the lord was evicted
from the capital, this is still a lively place.

03:14.870 --> 03:16.760
I suppose so... Huh?

03:17.280 --> 03:18.640
Where's Aishia?

03:18.640 --> 03:19.260
Huh?

03:26.210 --> 03:29.190
Aishia, what are you doing?

03:30.970 --> 03:34.020
Are you with this beauty?

03:34.020 --> 03:37.790
Yes, I'm sorry.
How much for the skewer?

03:37.790 --> 03:39.660
No need.

03:40.050 --> 03:42.410
The guy over there already paid for that.

03:43.040 --> 03:47.010
Why don't you two eat as well?
We got nice food here.

03:47.010 --> 03:49.560
No, we can't just...

03:49.560 --> 03:51.580
Come on, mi casa, su casa!
Don't hold back!

03:51.580 --> 03:56.300
Guy seemed to hit a jackpot after landing a gig
on preparing for the Hero's ship departure.

03:56.690 --> 03:58.820
Just sharing the happiness, so he said.

03:58.820 --> 04:00.810
The Hero's ship departure?

04:01.270 --> 04:02.240
Is that so?

04:02.240 --> 04:02.810
Yeah.

04:03.420 --> 04:06.880
They mentioned there'll be
an announcement party,

04:06.880 --> 04:10.330
with the Hero and the others invited to it.

04:11.530 --> 04:14.970
How does this Hero look like?

04:14.970 --> 04:16.070
What's their name?

04:16.750 --> 04:19.320
Sorry, I don't know that much.

04:19.710 --> 04:23.700
So, where is the Hero going on the ship?

04:24.480 --> 04:30.150
They all went to Galarc alongside
the princess and her followers.

04:35.420 --> 04:40.470
So that dragon thing is really bad news?

04:40.470 --> 04:44.780
Yes. It is certain normal
people can't take it down.

04:45.330 --> 04:46.560
Worst case scenario,

04:46.560 --> 04:50.910
we must abandon the city,
and consider evacuating the citizens.

04:50.910 --> 04:54.730
Leave it to me to evacuate them.

04:55.260 --> 04:57.850
Please do that.

04:58.350 --> 05:01.700
By the way, what do you think,
Duke Huguenot?

05:02.580 --> 05:04.080
Let's see...

05:04.080 --> 05:05.660
What should we do now...

05:07.250 --> 05:09.160
Got a moment, Liselotte?

05:10.420 --> 05:12.510
What do you want to do?

05:13.060 --> 05:15.360
I'll return to Amande.

05:15.360 --> 05:19.050
I have an acting governor there,
but I'm still the actual governor of the city.

05:19.740 --> 05:22.480
Hang on, are you trying
to use the magic ship?

05:22.480 --> 05:25.180
If you fly on that,
thing'll get excited.

05:25.180 --> 05:28.640
Yes. Which is why I plan
on using the land road.

05:29.090 --> 05:33.940
Fortunately, I can reach there from Noix
if I depart early in the morning.

05:34.250 --> 05:37.340
On land? Only you and your maids?

05:37.340 --> 05:39.590
No need to worry.

05:39.590 --> 05:42.750
My maids have already
received battle training.

05:43.120 --> 05:44.500
Master Hiroaki.

05:44.500 --> 05:49.890
If you pry too much,
you'll be troubling her.

05:50.700 --> 05:52.650
But, Roanna...

05:55.810 --> 05:57.250
Okay, I got it.

05:57.250 --> 05:59.210
Yeah, I got it.

05:59.690 --> 06:01.720
So you understand?

06:02.390 --> 06:04.680
I'll go with you as well.

06:05.010 --> 06:05.680
Huh?

06:05.680 --> 06:07.370
Master Hiroaki!

06:07.370 --> 06:11.680
As if I, the Hero, can let this slide.

06:12.050 --> 06:12.940
But...

06:13.330 --> 06:15.570
Hold it, Roanna.

06:16.140 --> 06:18.990
We can't just ignore his opinion.

06:18.990 --> 06:21.940
However, Duke Huguenot...

06:22.450 --> 06:25.190
Master Hiroaki is the Hero.

06:25.190 --> 06:28.450
We are not one to order him around.

06:29.060 --> 06:30.200
That's...

06:30.770 --> 06:33.450
Please hold it, Duke Huguenot.

06:33.450 --> 06:39.210
We can't just have the Hero from
another country risk his life for us...

06:39.540 --> 06:41.710
Liselotte, hear me out.

06:42.230 --> 06:44.220
I swear I'll act like a hero,

06:44.220 --> 06:48.470
and be willing to help Duke Huguenot
and the rest of you.

06:48.880 --> 06:53.060
However, if you can convince me to.

06:53.820 --> 06:58.860
If only I get to run away to safety,
that'll contradict my aesthetic.

06:59.870 --> 07:01.860
That's what he said.
What do you think?

07:02.260 --> 07:07.350
Even if things go south,
we swear we will not pin this on you.

07:08.830 --> 07:10.120
Are you serious?

07:10.530 --> 07:11.950
I am.

07:11.950 --> 07:16.350
After all, I can't just let
Master Hiroaki act on his own.

07:16.830 --> 07:19.050
Will that be fine with you, Lady Flora?

07:20.990 --> 07:22.780
Y-Yes.

07:22.780 --> 07:27.390
We can't just get to safety
while leaving Master Hiroaki alone.

07:27.770 --> 07:30.890
Well, I'm just escorting you to Amande.

07:31.380 --> 07:33.300
It can't be that dangerous.

07:33.680 --> 07:36.520
Besides, if things really go south,

07:36.850 --> 07:40.480
that's when you rely on me.

07:43.730 --> 07:44.780
That's...

07:44.780 --> 07:46.730
Proof of my heroic ability...

07:47.380 --> 07:50.030
My divine weapon, Yamata-no-Orochi!

07:50.030 --> 07:53.290
Yamata-no-Orochi?

07:53.680 --> 07:57.290
Yeah, I christened her myself.

08:12.270 --> 08:13.730
Understood.

08:14.220 --> 08:15.770
Aria!

08:16.090 --> 08:19.070
Could you be Aria Governess?

08:20.380 --> 08:21.440
Friend of yours?

08:22.830 --> 08:25.110
My apologies.

08:25.110 --> 08:30.700
I am Duke Huguenot's Knight Captain,
tasked with escorting you ladies.

08:30.700 --> 08:32.700
My name is Raymond Brandt.

08:33.170 --> 08:36.230
Pleased to meet your acquaintance,
Lady Liselotte.

08:36.230 --> 08:40.670
My pleasure as well, Mister Raymond.

08:41.590 --> 08:43.650
So, how do you know Aria?

08:44.050 --> 08:46.880
It has been a while,
Lord Raymond Brandt.

08:47.280 --> 08:52.390
I knew it was you!
I was wondering how'd you been.

08:52.390 --> 08:57.020
I'm sorry... about your family.

08:57.460 --> 09:02.330
Your worry about a fallen family
of someone like me...

09:02.330 --> 09:03.980
Thank you for your kindness.

09:03.980 --> 09:08.990
Fortunately, Lady Liselotte took me in,
and I'm getting by.

09:09.920 --> 09:11.170
Liselotte.

09:12.050 --> 09:14.450
Seems like the Hero
has already arrived.

09:14.450 --> 09:16.540
You should depart now.

09:16.860 --> 09:20.040
Duke Huguenot, good morning.

09:34.450 --> 09:37.560
It's nice to get on a carriage sometimes, eh.

09:37.950 --> 09:40.800
Don't let your guard down, Master Hiroaki.

09:41.840 --> 09:44.020
Don't worry about me.

09:44.980 --> 09:48.580
Lady Flora, you must not be used to
traveling in a carriage on a bad road.

09:48.580 --> 09:52.570
Should you feel sick,
feel free to let me know.

09:52.570 --> 09:55.970
Well, I'm just, uh,
not good at speaking,

09:55.970 --> 10:00.040
so it just calms me to listen
to what you're talking about...

10:00.800 --> 10:03.510
Forgive my rudeness.

10:03.510 --> 10:07.430
In that case,
would you care for a chat with me?

10:07.430 --> 10:10.800
I'd like to know more about you, if you like.

10:11.490 --> 10:13.050
Yes, gladly!

10:13.520 --> 10:16.510
Hey, don't forget about us here.

10:16.830 --> 10:18.130
Of course...

10:18.130 --> 10:19.280
Stop the convoy!

10:19.280 --> 10:21.020
There are demons about!

10:21.020 --> 10:23.380
All hands, assume battle formation!

10:31.980 --> 10:33.550
What?!

10:33.550 --> 10:34.700
Huh?!

10:36.540 --> 10:38.400
What? Demons?

10:38.400 --> 10:39.160
Where?

10:39.160 --> 10:43.160
There are a large amount
of them from both directions!

10:45.040 --> 10:49.040
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

10:52.430 --> 10:55.910
That's strange... I could only sense
their presence at the last minute.

10:55.910 --> 10:57.050
But how...

10:59.080 --> 11:01.270
Knights, ready your shields!

11:12.490 --> 11:14.030
What's going on?!

11:14.960 --> 11:16.240
Magic Barrier!

11:18.950 --> 11:21.980
Get the wounded behind the carriage!

11:21.980 --> 11:24.620
Duke Huguenot,
please don't come outside!

11:25.200 --> 11:29.380
Captain Raymond,
I leave the front line to you!

11:29.820 --> 11:31.250
Understood!

11:31.250 --> 11:33.340
There's more demons on our flank!

11:33.800 --> 11:35.340
More of them up front...

11:37.980 --> 11:39.190
No way...

11:39.670 --> 11:41.980
That must be a hundred... Two... Wait, three!

11:41.980 --> 11:43.970
How many are there?!

11:44.410 --> 11:46.730
They're coming from left and right as well!

11:46.730 --> 11:51.190
Lady Liselotte, please don't leave
the carriage at all costs.

11:51.190 --> 11:54.740
The carriage wall should be able
to handle throwing stones.

11:55.140 --> 11:56.340
Got it.

11:56.990 --> 11:59.300
I'll handle the enemies on the front.

11:59.300 --> 12:03.470
When I start attacking,
you three, disable the barrier,

12:03.470 --> 12:05.340
and attack accordingly.

12:05.340 --> 12:06.510
Got it?

12:06.510 --> 12:07.460
Yes!

12:08.090 --> 12:11.200
Knights, keep up the defence.

12:11.200 --> 12:13.290
Leave the offence to us.

12:17.950 --> 12:19.290
Magic Cannon!

12:40.450 --> 12:43.540
That's our Reaping Princess.
So dependable.

12:43.540 --> 12:47.050
Don't get fascinated just yet.
We're attacking now.

12:47.450 --> 12:48.530
Sure...

12:48.530 --> 12:49.580
Grace.

12:50.810 --> 12:53.980
Natalie, Chloe, and I will take it from here.

12:53.980 --> 12:56.650
The rest of you get the other side.

12:56.650 --> 12:58.730
Understood. Come on.

12:58.730 --> 13:00.710
Enchant Physical Ability.

13:01.280 --> 13:02.050
Chloe.

13:02.050 --> 13:07.060
Get rid of the oncoming small fries
behind the knights with your Photon Bullet.

13:07.670 --> 13:10.540
Try not to hit friendlies.

13:10.540 --> 13:11.340
Okay!

13:12.320 --> 13:14.520
We're going now, Natalie.

13:14.850 --> 13:16.640
Ready when you are.

13:17.700 --> 13:19.870
Enchant Physical Ability.

13:27.080 --> 13:30.640
We have a woman
on another level here, eh.

13:30.640 --> 13:34.080
She must be
Liselotte Cretia's right-hand woman.

13:34.890 --> 13:37.530
The defence on both sides is so tight.

13:38.050 --> 13:42.500
All of Liselotte's
underlings sure are excellent.

13:43.760 --> 13:47.430
However, there is an opening I can use.

13:49.050 --> 13:49.930
Hey!

13:50.450 --> 13:52.490
What's going on outside?!

13:52.490 --> 13:54.440
Are they okay?!

13:54.800 --> 13:59.190
Don't worry.
All the people outside are pros at battles.

13:59.190 --> 14:03.990
But, with that many knights,
how can it be not over yet?!

14:03.990 --> 14:05.450
What's going on here?!

14:05.830 --> 14:08.830
Master Hiroaki, let's believe in them.

14:08.830 --> 14:12.010
Huh? We're not getting
anything from outside.

14:12.010 --> 14:15.020
I can't trust someone I don't know.

14:15.020 --> 14:17.710
People who trust them sure are idiots...

14:18.400 --> 14:19.710
But...

14:25.490 --> 14:26.970
I'm sorry.

14:27.690 --> 14:30.990
I'm embarrassed to admit this,
but I'm actually frightened...

14:30.990 --> 14:34.480
Could you let me hold your hand?

14:34.880 --> 14:35.850
Sure!

14:38.810 --> 14:41.090
You must be scared too, Roanna.

14:41.630 --> 14:42.800
When it comes to that,

14:42.800 --> 14:47.540
I'll unleash Yamata-no-Orochi
and protect you, so don't worry.

14:48.050 --> 14:49.510
How reassuring.

14:53.300 --> 14:54.870
Wh-What?

14:56.910 --> 14:59.350
Wh-What just fell down?

14:59.350 --> 15:01.630
There can't be a monster above, can it?!

15:01.990 --> 15:03.130
I don't know!

15:04.310 --> 15:07.390
I've had enough!

15:07.950 --> 15:09.590
We're going out!

15:13.290 --> 15:16.620
Master Hiroaki! Please wait!

15:17.410 --> 15:18.950
Master Hero!

15:18.950 --> 15:21.700
What a handful!

15:21.700 --> 15:26.650
Um, what should we do?
We must go after him!

15:26.650 --> 15:28.970
I'll go check outside.

15:28.970 --> 15:31.450
Please stay close to me.

15:31.450 --> 15:32.580
Okay!

15:36.180 --> 15:37.520
Magic Barrier.

15:41.090 --> 15:42.590
What's going on?

15:42.930 --> 15:46.590
So there's a lot of demons
hiding in the forest?

15:49.970 --> 15:52.290
Lady Flora, this way.

15:52.290 --> 15:52.970
Okay.

15:55.930 --> 15:58.900
You guys got off too?

15:59.280 --> 16:00.650
Are you okay?

16:00.990 --> 16:04.970
Okay? Of course I'm not!
What's going on here?

16:04.970 --> 16:06.030
Can we even win this?

16:06.620 --> 16:10.070
It's not up to us amateurs
to assess the situation.

16:10.450 --> 16:14.110
However, from how it looks, they seem
to be able to keep their formation.

16:14.110 --> 16:16.540
Let's pray they can hold the demons off.

16:16.890 --> 16:18.950
What the heck...

16:18.950 --> 16:21.540
This is one crappy world!

16:21.940 --> 16:26.800
The Hero who got a cheat power should be
swinging his sword in his first battle gracefully!

16:27.170 --> 16:30.650
No one asked for this
hard mode of a world!

16:30.650 --> 16:31.800
Lady Roanna.

16:32.190 --> 16:34.560
Could I leave Lady Flora with you?

16:34.890 --> 16:37.760
I'll go tend to the wounded with my magic.

16:38.560 --> 16:42.060
Of course.
Please take care of them.

16:42.580 --> 16:43.600
Thank you.

16:43.600 --> 16:45.030
Lady Liselotte!

16:45.510 --> 16:47.980
Hey, wait, Liselotte.

16:49.370 --> 16:51.620
What the heck...

16:51.620 --> 16:55.540
Isn't this just one of those
stressful moments in the novels!

16:59.810 --> 17:01.520
Are you conscious?

17:02.830 --> 17:03.750
Heal.

17:04.860 --> 17:07.210
Milady, are you okay?

17:07.210 --> 17:10.930
Yes. Anyway, what's the situation?

17:12.230 --> 17:15.190
We're on the defensive on three directions.

17:15.600 --> 17:20.490
I've already dealt with the ones up front,
so we'll handle the rest to the other maids.

17:20.980 --> 17:23.650
I'm about to head to our flank now.

17:23.650 --> 17:27.270
I see. Wrap it up already, then.

17:27.270 --> 17:28.650
I'm counting on you.

17:29.220 --> 17:32.110
Understood. I'll be back soon.

17:34.050 --> 17:37.660
All right, I must do what I can as well.

17:40.020 --> 17:42.610
So she's moving to the rear, huh?

17:42.610 --> 17:44.790
My diversion is a success, then.

17:44.790 --> 17:45.970
Well, then...

17:49.770 --> 17:51.430
How powerful...

17:56.310 --> 17:58.230
Is it that curse sword?

17:58.230 --> 18:02.180
Or maybe it's her own power?

18:03.250 --> 18:06.720
I think I can handle
the demons here on my own.

18:07.120 --> 18:09.990
Could you handle the rest
on the right and left?

18:09.990 --> 18:13.490
Really? Now that's amazing.

18:17.300 --> 18:18.460
What?!

18:26.400 --> 18:28.210
You're kidding me...

18:29.070 --> 18:31.210
That's the same demon from back then...

18:31.620 --> 18:34.720
Lady Roanna, are you familiar with it?

18:35.600 --> 18:40.300
That's a minotaur, the one who raged on
during the Divine-Demon War!

18:40.300 --> 18:42.060
A legendary one!

18:42.540 --> 18:45.210
Man, we're so cooked...

18:51.330 --> 18:52.640
Where did it come from...

19:07.730 --> 19:09.040
Lady Liselotte!

19:48.630 --> 19:50.460
Lady Flora!

20:26.450 --> 20:27.830
I'll help.

20:36.480 --> 20:38.090
It's just like that time...

20:44.500 --> 20:46.100
Lady Liselotte!

20:48.080 --> 20:49.140
Who are you?

20:54.540 --> 20:55.980
We'll talk later.

20:59.670 --> 21:00.610
A curse sword...

21:17.790 --> 21:20.680
No way! He sent that giant flying!

21:51.390 --> 21:53.600
We did it!

22:02.460 --> 22:03.450
Ah...

23:40.020 --> 23:40.910
NEXT EPISODE: THE WEDGE OF MEMORIES

23:40.910 --> 23:42.230
NEXT EPISODE: THE WEDGE OF MEMORIES
The Wedge of Memories.

23:42.230 --> 23:45.030
NEXT EPISODE: THE WEDGE OF MEMORIES

23:45.030 --> 23:46.450
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

23:46.450 --> 23:48.140
MOO

23:48.140 --> 23:51.110
ILLUSTRATION BY: FUTAGO MINAZUKI
